        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Explore Jumanji’s lost world of dangerous beasts and secret treasures.\n\nDrop into the dangerous game world of Jumanji and start a thrilling adventure, as you search for the stolen jewel, The Jaguar’s Eye, and a way home!\n\nChoose your avatar from heroes Smolder Bravestone, Ruby Roundhouse, Mouse Finbar, and Shelly Oberon, and explore uncharted territories home to fierce predators, warring factions and devious traps that can sweep you off your feet.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Explora el mundo perdido de Jumanji, lleno de bestias peligrosas y tesoros secretos.\n\nAdéntrate en el peligroso mundo de juego de Jumanji y comienza una emocionante aventura en la que buscarás la joya robada, The Jaguar's Eye, y un camino de regreso a casa.\n\nElige tu avatar entre los héroes Smolder Bravestone, Ruby Roundhouse, Mouse Finbar y Shelly Oberon, y explora territorios inexplorados habitados por feroces depredadores, facciones enfrentadas y trampas engañosas que pueden derribarte.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2023",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
